1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:50,490
10 years ago

25
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,880
Stop running !

26
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,040
Stop him !

27
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:53,890
Stay where you are !

28
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,440
Hand over the bell and I'll spare your life !

29
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,560
Stop !

30
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:04,290
I'll handle this.

31
00:02:08,040 --> 00:02:10,850
Zhao Guo
Rogue cultivator
10th layer of Qi Condensation

32
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:11,440
Young Master Teng, this is my family heirloom,

33
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:12,600
it's useless to you !

34
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:15,250
Teng Li
14th layer of Qi Condensation

35
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,730
Even if it's useless,

36
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:18,240
I still I want it !

37
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,560
Hand it over ! Now !

38
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:21,360
Hurry !

39
00:02:21,640 --> 00:02:23,930
Are the lives of low level cultivators like me

40
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,960
worthless to you !?

41
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,280
Give it !

42
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:59,040
Li'er greets Grandfather.

43
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:04,120
My dear grandson,

44
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:06,600
you're the heir of the Teng Family.

45
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:09,640
You can take whatever you want.

46
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:14,240
All the treasures under this sky are yours.

47
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:28,370
What's wrong with this place ?

48
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,730
My Divine Sense is locked at 300 meters...

49
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,760
After I flatten this place,

50
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,040
you won't have anywhere to hide !

51
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,600
What the hell !?

52
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:07,240
You won't trap me !

53
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,280
Scram !

54
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,040
Now's the time !

55
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,240
You dared to ambush me...

56
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,000
Damn it !

57
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:58,640
When I catch you,

58
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:01,240
I'll make you suffer !

59
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:03,160
I'll extract your soul

60
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:05,640
and I will refine it until you die !

61
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,800
Senior !

62
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:09,920
Relax, I'm not dead yet.

63
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:13,360
This brat is a hundred times more talented than you.

64
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:15,440
He never had to struggle

65
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:17,130
and was fed with a silver spoon.

66
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,960
Without that artifact he had,

67
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,720
he'd be dead already.

68
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:24,400
I had to destroy that artifact he had in order to kill him.

69
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,290
It's okay,

70
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,800
we're just getting started.

71
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:50,520
Little Lin, what are you looking for ?

72
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,040
Found it.

73
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,040
There you are.

74
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:04,210
Why did you stop running ?

75
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:32,320
You have nowhere to escape to !

76
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,730
Senior, help me !

77
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:13,200
What is this stench ?

78
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:18,450
Another one of his schemes !

79
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:22,570
Wu Yu's Corpse

80
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,770
A Green Core ?

81
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:28,010
I never thought someone would cultivate the Green Core Method.

82
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:31,120
This is nothing like a Golden Core.

83
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,160
It's an explosive

84
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,690
with devastating power.

85
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:35,650
Luckily, we're far enough.

86
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:04,600
This looks like a semi-sentient Corpse Puppet.

87
00:08:04,760 --> 00:08:07,560
How did you know it was here ?

88
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:12,730
I sensed that all the spiritual energy

89
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:14,080
was converging towards here.

90
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:16,040
But strangely,

91
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,800
the closer we got,

92
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,840
the sparser the Blue Thread Vines.

93
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,640
So...

94
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,920
I guessed that this place hides

95
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:25,800
something even the vines fear.

96
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:30,840
That brat is probably just fleeing now.

97
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,080
Since he gave up chasing you,

98
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:34,080
it's time to counterattack.

99
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,760
Trying to run ?

100
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,160
I won't let you.

101
00:08:58,560 --> 00:09:00,280
Your lowly life

102
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:02,440
isn't worth enough to die together !

103
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:06,160
He's gambling

104
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:07,560
on whose sword is faster.

105
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:10,200
I can still teleport you, don't risk it !

106
00:09:13,160 --> 00:09:14,920
Teng Li will die today !

107
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:26,440
Madman !

108
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,880
You're insane !

109
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:28,600
Die !

110
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,480
Senior !

111
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:52,290
Note: A bag of holding is basically a transportable compressed space used for storage.

112
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:36,840
Kid, you were reckless.

113
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,440
Had I been slower,

114
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,880
you'd be dead !

115
00:10:42,560 --> 00:10:45,050
This was my only chance to kill Teng Li.

116
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,480
If I had missed it

117
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:48,160
and allowed him to recover,

118
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,840
it would've been over.

119
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,000
But that gamble was too risky !

120
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,440
It wasn't a gamble.

121
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,640
He was exhausted

122
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:57,840
and couldn't outspeed my sword.

123
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:01,400
Wang Lin,

124
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:03,360
I feel like I met a new you today.

125
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:06,330
Even I might not have dared

126
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,800
to gamble like that.

127
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:14,080
Will it work if I use Foundation Stealing on him ?

128
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,400
Perfectly.

129
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:19,400
He reached Late stage Foundation Establishment at such a young age

130
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:21,320
and his talent is exceptional.

131
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:23,920
Senior, please guard me while I use your method.

132
00:12:10,920 --> 00:12:12,400
If you kill me,

133
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,840
my grandfather will hunt you !

134
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:22,440
Grandfather, save me !

135
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,520
Li'er !

136
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,650
Who is it ?!

137
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,360
Stop !

138
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:59,000
If you spare my grandson's soul

139
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:01,360
I promise to spare you !

140
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:03,440
He killed my friend

141
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:04,960
and tried to kill me.

142
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:06,600
He's evil.

143
00:13:06,580 --> 00:13:08,410
He isn't dying meaninglessly,

144
00:13:08,160 --> 00:13:10,250
but helping my cultivation.

145
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:19,090
If you dare to kill my grandson

146
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,680
and scatter his soul,

147
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:23,690
even if I need to search the whole planet,

148
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:26,800
I, Teng Huayuan, will take your life !

149
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:44,240
Li'er !!!

150
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,120
Ancestor...

151
00:13:57,880 --> 00:14:00,520
don't waste your Nascent Soul's Soul Blood !

152
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:02,760
I swear that

153
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:05,120
I will search heaven and earth

154
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:08,440
and I will avenge you !

155
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:13,840
Curse,

156
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:15,400
go !

157
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,360
Curse,

158
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:22,200
activate !

159
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:30,640
Whoever kills a Teng

160
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:35,120
shall suffer Teng Huayuan's curse !

161
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:04,440
A Nascent Soul cultivator cursed you at great cost.

162
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:06,960
If you get too close to him

163
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:08,920
he will teleport to you instantly.

164
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:10,120
Senior,

165
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:12,000
is there any way to break this curse ?

166
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:13,400
Don't panic.

167
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:15,400
Just keep your distance.

168
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:17,000
Since I'm with you,

169
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:19,240
he will never be able to find you.

170
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,360
Now,

171
00:16:19,760 --> 00:16:21,200
to continue to cultivate

172
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:25,050
you need to find an extreme Yin energy gathering spot.

173
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:28,800
Cultivate the Underworld Ascension Method I taught you.

174
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:30,850
You...

175
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:32,200
Senior !

176
00:16:39,490 --> 00:18:41,900
Teng Huayuan had a jade that cracked when Teng Li died. It's very common for sects or families to have objects that represent the life of a disciple. The disciple will leave a part of his Divine Sense inside it so that when he dies, the Divine Sense will vanish to inform of his death. Most of the time it will be a jade slip or a lamp.

177
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:51,210
I've been walking this path for endless years

178
00:16:47,970 --> 00:16:51,210
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

179
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:56,810
Is it the compass of fate

180
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:56,810
that wrote this outcome for us ?

181
00:16:56,720 --> 00:17:02,730
The heavens want to erase your existence,

182
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:08,450
that's the obsession guiding me.

183
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:14,050
Is this the path to uncover

184
00:17:10,360 --> 00:17:14,050
truths from falsehoods ?

185
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:19,650
In a world of murk and shadow,

186
00:17:15,980 --> 00:17:19,650
only the flame of truth can light the way.

187
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:25,370
Look at them all,

188
00:17:22,320 --> 00:17:25,370
being carried by the waves.

189
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:30,010
Look at them all,

190
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:30,010
being drowned.

191
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:33,330
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

192
00:17:33,120 --> 00:17:36,410
I will let the world refine my soul.

193
00:17:36,290 --> 00:17:41,970
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

194
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:41,970
I will fight.

195
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:45,090
I'll break through the abyss of despair

196
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:48,130
to finally learn who I really am.

197
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:53,490
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

198
00:17:49,760 --> 00:17:53,490
I embrace this obsession.

199
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:56,450
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

200
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:59,250
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

201
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:04,730
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

202
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:04,730
I'll still fight.

203
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:08,090
It's hard to avoid loneliness

204
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:11,130
when you are above everyone else.

205
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:16,810
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

206
00:18:13,200 --> 00:18:16,810
be afraid of a firefly ?
